      "captions": [
        {
          "t_ms": 1795442866113,
          "media_time": 284.33,
          "text_zh": "我以前也总是说“你好”，但有一次被骂了。",
          "prev_zh": ""
        },
        {
          "t_ms": 1795442869614,
          "media_time": 287.83,
          "text_zh": "“亲切”这词平时就是打招呼用的，难道没有含义吗？",
          "prev_zh": ""
        },
        {
          "t_ms": 1795442869714,
          "media_time": 287.92,
          "text_zh": "嗯。",
          "prev_zh": "“亲切”这词平时就是打招呼用的，难道没有含义吗？"
        },
        {
          "t_ms": 1795442874014,
          "media_time": 292.23,
          "text_zh": "这么说起来，保育员啊。",
          "prev_zh": ""
        },
        {
          "t_ms": 1795442875814,
          "media_time": 294.03,
          "text_zh": "欢迎回家，来接孩子的父母。",
          "prev_zh": "这么说起来，保育员啊。"
        },
        {
          "t_ms": 1795442877413,
          "media_time": 295.62,
          "text_zh": "好的。",
          "prev_zh": "欢迎回家，来接孩子的父母。"
        },
        {
          "t_ms": 1795442882014,
          "media_time": 300.23,
          "text_zh": "对，早上要送出去。",
          "prev_zh": ""
        },
        {
          "t_ms": 1795442886914,
          "media_time": 305.12,
          "text_zh": "那我们也要说“欢迎回来”吧。",
          "prev_zh": ""
        },
        {
          "t_ms": 1795442888914,
          "media_time": 307.13,
          "text_zh": "绝对放弃。",
          "prev_zh": "那我们也要说“欢迎回来”吧。"
        },
        {
          "t_ms": 1795442893814,
          "media_time": 312.03,
          "text_zh": "我懂的。",
          "prev_zh": ""
        },
        {
          "t_ms": 1795442895813,
          "media_time": 314.02,
          "text_zh": "谢谢，可不是那样。",
          "prev_zh": "我懂的。"
        },
        {
          "t_ms": 1795442900414,
          "media_time": 318.62,
          "text_zh": "怎么都不顺啊。",
          "prev_zh": ""
        },
        {
          "t_ms": 1795442907814,
          "media_time": 729.77,
          "text_zh": "可爱！",
          "prev_zh": ""
        },
        {
          "t_ms": 1795442916013,
          "media_time": 737.97,
          "text_zh": "好久不见，三人是多久以前的事了？",
          "prev_zh": ""
        },
        {
          "t_ms": 1795442919513,
          "media_time": 741.47,
          "text_zh": "什么时候呢？",
          "prev_zh": ""
        },
        {
          "t_ms": 1795442923913,
          "media_time": 745.87,
          "text_zh": "时隔13年啊。",
          "prev_zh": ""
        }
      ],
      "captions_before_jump": 12,
      "captions_after_jump": 4,
